# Cross-polarity repertoire: real/small backward, forward, or guarded-sparse
# crossed with unreal/formula guarded-sparse or unreal/automaton forward.
# Each line selects one actual two-arm invocation sharing the whole budget.
# rf-ugf is the previously measured fixed-pair control.
rb-ugf|real:small:backward,unreal:formula:spot-guarded-sparse
rf-ugf|real:small:forward,unreal:formula:spot-guarded-sparse
rg-ugf|real:small:spot-guarded-sparse,unreal:formula:spot-guarded-sparse
rb-ufa|real:small:backward,unreal:automaton:forward
rf-ufa|real:small:forward,unreal:automaton:forward
rg-ufa|real:small:spot-guarded-sparse,unreal:automaton:forward
